WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.743 --> 00:00:12.489
Sign in as the platform admin.

2
00:00:12.589 --> 00:00:19.109
Support collects the questions and problems that businesses send you. Needs reply shows what is waiting.

3
00:00:19.209 --> 00:00:24.300
Open a ticket to read the conversation. This one comes from FreshMart Grocers.

4
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:31.243
Type your answer at the bottom. The Internal note option keeps a note for admins only.

5
00:00:31.343 --> 00:00:36.653
Send the reply. The business sees it right away, and the ticket moves to Answered.

6
00:00:36.753 --> 00:00:42.010
Click Close request when the problem is solved. The business can reopen it later.

7
00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:48.081
Announcements are notices shown to businesses at the top of their app. Click New announcement.

8
00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:53.334
Write a title and a message, and choose a style, such as info or warning.

9
00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:59.954
Pick the audience, everyone or the businesses on one plan, and optional start and end dates. Then save.

10
00:01:00.054 --> 00:01:05.478
The announcement is live. You can turn it off or edit it from this list at any time.

11
00:01:05.578 --> 00:01:11.549
The Audit log records everything admins do in this panel. Entries cannot be edited or deleted.

12
00:01:11.649 --> 00:01:17.731
Each row shows when, who, what happened and from which address. Your new announcement is listed.

13
00:01:17.831 --> 00:01:23.747
Filter by admin, by event or by date to find what you need. That is care for your businesses.
